m for all guests. Seating is general admission\, first-come\, first-served\
 
, with the exception of groups and premium booths. No cell phone use\, phot
 
ography or video recording is permitted during performances. All sales are 
 
final. MISCELLANOUS: For group sales info\, e-mail our Events Manager to le
 
arn about special menu options and reserved seating. Additional questions m
 
ay be addressed in our Frequently Asked Questions. For further assistance\,
 
 contact Brea Improv Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/tokyo-
 
